This project is a course implementation of the "LLM Twin" system described
in Part Two of:

  LLM Engineer's Handbook
  Paul Iusztin & Maxime Labonne
  Packt Publishing

Reference implementation: https://github.com/PacktPublishing/LLM-Engineers-Handbook

Architectural patterns (FTI pipeline separation, instruction-dataset
generation approach, query expansion + self-query + reranking retrieval
flow, golden-set / LLM-as-judge evaluation) are adapted from the book and
its companion repository. Code in this repository is an original
implementation written for this assignment, not a copy of the reference
repo, unless a file explicitly states otherwise.
